{
  "id": "burner-gas-low-nox",
  "name": "Low-NOx gas burner (package and ultra-low-NOx)",
  "equipment_type": "burner",
  "description": "Burner that stages fuel and air, delays mixing or recirculates flue gas to lower flame temperature and NOx formation. Package gas burners span roughly 10-500 MMBtu/hr with 10:1 turndown; ultra-low-NOx versions reach single-digit ppm NOx with flue-gas recirculation or surface-stabilised premixed combustion. Used on fire-tube, water-tube and hot-water boilers and on refinery fired heaters. Primary source: https://cleaverbrooks.com/product/sbr30-burner",
